        "abstract": "Human Attention is a finite resource and we need better tools to measure and manage it. We suggest an Open Eyewear Platform, a toolset to quantify social and cognitive functions of individuals and groups of people in real life settings using physiological sensing (e.g. eye movements, blink patterns, facial expressions etc.). This paper motivates smart sensing eyewear as an enabling technology for various application cases from behavior quantification to Human sensory amplification and scaffolding technologies.",
